        <activityName xml:lang="en">Titanium dioxide, chloride process, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Titanium dioxide, chloride process, at plant
Titanium dioxide produced by the chloride process, preferred by paint, coatings and plastics manufacturers. Inventory data are confidential;
CAS number: 013463-67-7; 
Formula: TiO2; 
Synonyms: rutil; 
UUID: bc92bf5a-94f5-3d3c-865f-278a6ba99440
Cradle-to-gate, includes all ancillary materials, precursors, transports and infrastructure.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: represents a current cross-section of actual plants in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: survey 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bc92bf5a-94f5-3d3c-865f-278a6ba99440.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
